        {
          "en": "What happened next?",
          "zh": "什么发生下一个？",
          "startMs": 60065,
          "endMs": 62103
        },
        {
          "en": "To help the child to remember the order that things happen in stories.",
          "zh": "到帮助这孩子到记得这条理那个东西发生在……里故事。",
          "startMs": 62103,
          "endMs": 69611
        },
        {
          "en": "• Open the book at any double page.",
          "zh": "• 打开这书在任何供两者用的页。",
          "startMs": 69611,
          "endMs": 73365
        },
        {
          "en": "What happened next?\"",
          "zh": "什么发生下一个？",
          "startMs": 73365,
          "endMs": 75511
        },
        {
          "en": "The child tries to remember what is on the next page.",
          "zh": "这孩子尝试到记得什么是在……上这下一个页。",
          "startMs": 75511,
          "endMs": 81195
        },
        {
          "en": "Look at the book and check if he/she is right.",
          "zh": "看在这书和查明如果他/她是正确的。",
          "startMs": 81195,
          "endMs": 86129
        },
        {
          "en": "• Then the child chooses a page and asks you, \"What happened next?\"",
          "zh": "• 然后这孩子选择一个页和问你， 什么发生下一个？",
          "startMs": 86129,
          "endMs": 93316
        },
        {
          "en": "• Have two or three turns each.",
          "zh": "• 有二或者三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 93316,
          "endMs": 96641
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 96641,
          "endMs": 102755
        },
        {
          "en": "• Find these words in the story that end in '-ed': 'liked\", 'looked', 'pulled\", 'wanted\", 'jumped\", 'climbed'.",
          "zh": "• 找到这些单词在……里这故事那个末尾在……里 '-勃起功能障碍'： '喜欢， '看'， '拉， '想要， '跳， '爬'。",
          "startMs": 102755,
          "endMs": 114553
        },
        {
          "en": "The child could try spelling as many of the words as he/she can.",
          "zh": "这孩子能尝试拼写像许多的这单词像他/她能。",
          "startMs": 114553,
          "endMs": 121418
        },
        {
          "en": "Find words beginning with 'w' in the story, asking the child to make a list.",
          "zh": "找到单词开始和……一起 'w' 在……里这故事， 问这孩子到做一个名单。",
          "startMs": 121418,
